//
// Inter-service gRPC contract for the Content Delivery core domain
// (chora_delivery database, Team 2 / Delivery). Surface: R+ Rhythm+
// (instructor / admin training-admin / scheduling / classroom / exam).
//
// Aggregates exposed:
//   - Course / Class       — admin construct grouping atoms for delivery
//   - Enrollment           — same-identity link (gcid + course_id) per
//                            Comic Ch4 P8 ("One Identity to Rule Them All")
//   - Class (scheduled)    — concrete time-bound delivery instance
//   - AttendanceRecord     — per-class per-learner attendance row
//   - Certificate          — issued credential
//
// Cross-DB queries FORBIDDEN — Course aggregate carries atom_ids only
// (UUIDs without FK; atom content remains owned by Creation).
//
// Course catalogue listing (ListPublicCourses) supports the Phyllis MVP
// "Udemy moment" (Comic Ch5 P10) — public discovery + same-identity
// enrollment without creating a new user record.
//
// Deployed in chora-delivery (Team 2 pool). mTLS via Cloud Service Mesh;
// SPIFFE identity in mesh; W3C trace context in gRPC metadata.
